Package: phylotriplet
Type: Package
Title: Phylogenetic Tree Estimation from Weighted Input Trees
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Knapp", email = "adam.knapp@medicine.ufl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Julia", "Chifman", email = "chifman@american.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Author: Adam Knapp [aut, cre], Julia Chifman [aut]
Maintainer: Adam Knapp <adam.knapp@medicine.ufl.edu>
Description: Estimates phylogenetic trees from weighted input trees. Supports
    input trees in Newick format with associated weights. Returns trees in APE
    phylo format for seamless integration with the R phylogenetics ecosystem.
    Particularly useful for estimating consensus trees from weighted triplets
    or other weighted tree sets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0),
    ape (>= 5.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: Eigen3 C++ header library
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    phytools
URL: https://github.com/knappa/phylotriplet
BugReports: https://github.com/knappa/phylotriplet/issues
